Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Package: edemint-desktop
Version: 0.1
Maintainer: Edemint <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ashcqriss/edemix
Architecture: all
Depends: edemint-base, hyprland, hyprlock, hypridle, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland, wlogout, swayosd, cliphist, wf-recorder, jq, @DEPS@
Description: Edemint desktop metapackage - Hyprland Wayland session
 The Edemint desktop metapackage pulls the release-critical Hyprland
 compositor, portal, lock and idle services, power menu, OSD, clipboard,
 recording utilities, and the complete general-purpose desktop userland.
 Missing session components are build failures; optional conveniences are not
 represented as dependencies of this package.
